  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>合作案例</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>一、百度地图车机版</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.1 分发优势</strong></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/5a1639c6b91e41ebbf661a98649c992f.png?auth_key=1795675073-52f75118cae740fa9b938a9d941c6d02-0-c3d3ca9ea6889cc5515ed5bcb97645a2e1289e1441284f4c7d0eb0e963935207\" alt=\"1.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1281.11px;height: 253.01px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 分发优势</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 智能语音联动</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>车机智能语音控制：</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•我要回家</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•去最近的电影院</span> </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/489a5a4fe82d41aea291a1a0b5247b32.png?auth_key=1795675073-a2fcb071646a432a9ebadcdd360f8a7f-0-ed62c7fb3623e2f5cbfc897b6c647b7b5f0c6710c1d635e0f14966af70616ea1\" alt=\"2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1255.00px;height: 713.78px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 智能语音联动</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.3 场景自动化</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>适用场景：日常通勤、外出游玩等</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>外出游玩：秋高气爽，带孩子游玩</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•打开音乐</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•播放指定歌单</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•导航景区公园</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">•调整空调温度</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7c738f0edaa146ffaa53efcd4db7dcbf.png?auth_key=1795675073-dcaf4eddc2ea4e51af6ee8ff4fb610fc-0-0ef756e03512b22467adf760b883cdd64ee063a33f29f0318a849b0cb9d26e5e\" alt=\"3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"\"> </p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 场景自动化</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">*功能实现与车机系统相关，以实际为准。</span></p>"
